# From the CD block hub's lift to the roof's edge nearest the arena's pyramid (BOOT_AT_HUB 1 in
# src/input.c: stood facing west): a half turn to face east, then walking to the edge, a shot
# every third of a second, and a look up and down there. The pyramid's walls and the skyline must
# stay (the user, 2026-11-13: "When up close to edge nearest to pyramid from the elevator, the
# pyramid walls and sky city clips out")
wait_up
wait 1.0
hold left 0.4
wait 0.4
hold left 0.4
wait 0.4
hold left 0.4
wait 0.4
hold left 0.4
wait 0.8
shot he_00_east
keydown up
wait 0.33
shot he_01
wait 0.33
shot he_02
wait 0.33
shot he_03
wait 0.33
shot he_04
wait 0.33
shot he_05
wait 0.33
shot he_06
wait 0.33
shot he_07
wait 0.33
shot he_08
keyup up
wait 0.5
shot he_09_stopped
keydown y
wait 0.8
shot he_10_up
keyup y
wait 0.6
keydown b
wait 0.8
shot he_11_down
keyup b
